--Power BI/Cold as Ice Bakery Folder-- Business Case Story: Cold as Ice Bakery needed a clear, unified view of how its products, customers, and regions were performing against budget. This Power BI dashboard brings financial and operational data together to show where revenue is coming from, how customer value is trending, and whether the business is meeting its revenue‑per‑customer targets. By visualizing Actual vs. Budget performance and highlighting key drivers like customer counts and product mix, the dashboard gives leadership a fast, reliable way to spot trends, diagnose gaps, and make smarter decisions.
